# STREAM_URL.md records the private named-tunnel URL and lives ONLY in the
# deploy dir (this repo is the public subset; deployment specifics are kept
# separate — see STREAM.md "Locked decisions"). Deploys copy files public→
# deploy; this guards the reverse — an accidental deploy→public copy can't
# stage the domain into the public repo. Other deploy-only files (SETUP.md,
# scripts/, worker/) are intentionally NOT ignored: they carry no secret and
# may be published redacted later; ignoring them would silently block that.
STREAM_URL.md
